<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7451" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνα-σείω</span></b> , poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνασσείω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνασσείασκε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Ap.</u>
					403
				</span></i>
			:— <i>shake back,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνασείοντά τε κόμας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					240
				</span></i>
			; <i>swing to and fro, brandish,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰγίδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					344
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὰς χεῖρας</span>
			<i>wave</i> the hands, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.38
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. φοινικίδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					6.51
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>brandish at</i> one, <i>threaten with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσαγγελίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					25.47
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοὴν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					347
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρὰ προσδοκίαν</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>shake out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					2.104a36
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv B. C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντα κάλων</span>
			<i>shake out</i> every reef, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.327
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὰ ἱστία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					6.12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>VS</u>
				2.32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάσας τὰς ἡνίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					1.214
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν χλαμύδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					1.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>stir up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πλήθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					2.290
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				8.81
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				13.91
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
				15.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				23.5
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be incited, encouraged,</i> c.
			inf., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				28.20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
